INTEGRATION PREFLIGHT FAILURE (non-counted; no valid child result)
The first capture helper accidentally used PowerShell's automatic $args variable as a function parameter. The intended Python command therefore launched once without its script argument. Observed child PID 44132 was stopped by the integration owner after it remained in the Python interpreter; the helper then began a second no-argument launch (PID 52116), which was also stopped. No child stdout/stderr bytes were available and no exit code was claimed. This event is retained as a wrapper failure only; it is not part of the authoritative four-process replay. The corrected launcher used ProcessStartInfo.ArgumentList and produced command receipts 01-04.
